Package: asariR
Title: R Reimplementation of Asari Metabolomics Preprocessing
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Zidong", "Xu", email = "zidong.xu@mail.mcgill.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Zidong Xu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Zidong Xu <zidong.xu@mail.mcgill.ca>
Description: An R reimplementation of the asari high-resolution mass
    spectrometry preprocessing workflow. It constructs mass tracks from
    centroided mzML data, aligns samples, detects chromatographic features,
    and exports full and preferred feature tables.
